<title>THAILAND: Thai stocks rally to end 3.02 pct higher on fund.</title>
<headline>Thai stocks rally to end 3.02 pct higher on fund.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai stocks rallied strongly in the last hour of trade on Thursday to finish 3.02 percent higher on buying by a private sector rescue fund which was launched to shore up the sagging market, brokers said.</p>
